WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Before you start. Skip any move that hurts. Do what your body allows. Sitting or standing is fine.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Shoulders. Lift them toward your ears. Hold for 5. Let go and drop them.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Hands. Make fists. Hold for 5. Open your fingers and let them rest.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Face. Scrunch your face. Hold for 5. Soften your jaw and forehead.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Legs and feet. Press your feet into the floor. Hold for 5. Release.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:39.000
Finish. Take one slow breath out. Notice what feels different.

